  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb"/>God is <chord name="Eb"/>my <chord name="Bb"/>strong salvation,<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>What <chord name="F"/>foe <chord name="Gm"/>have <chord name="F"/>I to <chord name="Bb"/>fear?<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>In darkness and temptation,<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>My <chord name="F"/>Light, <chord name="Gm"/>my <chord name="F"/>Help, is <chord name="Bb"/>near:<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Though hosts <chord name="Eb"/>encamp <chord name="Gm"/>around <chord name="F"/>me,<br/>
      <chord name="Cm/Eb"/>Firm <chord name="Bb/D"/>in the <chord name="Cm"/>fight I stand;<br/>
      <chord name="Bb/D"/>What <chord name="Eb"/>terror <chord name="Gm"/>can <chord name="Dm"/>confound <chord name="Eb"/>me,<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>With <chord name="F"/>God <chord name="Bb/D"/>at <chord name="Eb"/>my <chord name="F"/>right <chord name="Bb"/>hand?
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Place on the reliance;<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>My <chord name="F"/>soul <chord name="Gm"/>with <chord name="F"/>courage <chord name="Bb"/>wait;<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>His truth be thine affiance,<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>When <chord name="F"/>faint <chord name="Gm"/>and <chord name="F"/>desolate.<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>His might <chord name="Eb"/>thy <chord name="Dm"/>heart <chord name="Gm"/>shall strengthen,<br/>
      <chord name="Cm/Eb"/>His <chord name="Bb/D"/>love thy <chord name="Cm"/>joy increase;<br/>
      <chord name="Bb/D"/>Mercy <chord name="F"/>thy <chord name="Gm"/>days <chord name="Dm"/>shall lengthen;<br/>
      <chord name="Eb"/>The <chord name="F"/>Lord <chord name="Bb/D"/>will <chord name="Eb"/>give <chord name="F"/>thee <chord name="Bb"/>peace.
      </lines>
    </verse>
  </lyrics>
